OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a mostly cloudy day
OL,6,Fwith showery outbreaks of light rain
OL,7,Fand drizzle. Best chance of dry and
OL,8,Fbright spells will be in the east.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FA largely cloudy evening with
OL,11,Fa few patches of light drizzle at
OL,12,Ffirst. Then mostly dry and cloudy
OL,13,Fovernight, perhaps some clear spells
OL,14,Fdeveloping in the north later.
OL,15,
OL,16,CMonday:FCloudy with some patchy light
OL,17,Frain and drizzle in the morning.
OL,18,FOutbreaks of rain will become more
OL,19,Fextensive through the afternoon,
OL,20,Fturning persistent and occasionally
OL,21,Fheavier later on.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
